{Time limit 30 moves in 1hr 15' then 6 moves per 15'} 1. Nf3 g6 2. e4 Bg7 3. d4
d6 4. Nc3 Nf6 5. Be2 O-O 6. O-O Nbd7 7. Bf4 c5 8. d5 a6 9. a4 {[14']} Ng4 $2 {
[8']} 10. Nd2 Ngf6 {[12']} 11. a5 {[22']} h6 {[18']} 12. Nc4 b5 {[23']} 13.
axb6 Nxb6 14. Na5 {[27']} Qc7 {[27']} 15. Bg3 {[38']} Nh7 {[34']} 16. Re1 Bd7
17. Qd2 Ng5 18. Bf1 f6 19. Nc4 Bb5 20. Na5 Bd7 21. Nb3 Nf7 {Carelessness!} 22.
Bxa6 Ne5 23. Bxe5 fxe5 24. Qe3 Kh7 25. Nd2 Rf7 26. Bb5 Rff8 {[1hr 11']} 27. Qe2
h5 {[1hr 12']} 28. Bxd7 Qxd7 29. Ra6 Rxa6 30. Qxa6 Bh6 31. Nf3 Rb8 {[1hr 18']
Adjourned. Unfortunately I had no time at all to analyse it and had to start
thinking again on restart immediately he sealed.} 32. Ra1 {[SM] The game
resumed on 29/1/80} Ra8 33. Qf1 Qb7 34. g3 Kg7 {[1hr 28'] White was playing
quickly having analysed it. I was getting short of time again 6m/15' is very
difficult under these conditions.} 35. Rxa8 Qxa8 36. Qb5 Qa7 {For the second
time in 7 moves I just make the time control.} 37. Kg2 Kf7 38. Qc6 Qb8 {
After a lot of thought. I was again very short of time.} 39. Nb5 Nc4 {I had no
time to work it out.} 40. Qd7 Nxb2 41. Nh4 {Now, with 2 moves to make in zero
time I had to move something so.........} Qe8 42. Nxd6+ {Mediocre stuff! I.D.
Wells had a FIDE rating of 2220} 1-0

